; body-extend-005 RAW_BYTES golden — H_33 0xA1 RAW_BYTES + RET
; 1-handler exercise: 0xA1 emits literal-byte args verbatim (variadic).
; Probe uses 2-byte variadic literal `A1 CC DD`. NOT RAW_BYTE 0xA0 filler
; — opcode 0xA1 routes through the real variadic literal-byte emit path.
; Expected bytes: ccdd c3 (3B).
; Mirror of selfhost_min_nop.ty template (single-handler, single-op).
40 27
  A1 CC DD
  FF

